# Voice and links

Read `.cursor/skills/chat-voice/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/show-before-send/SKILL.md` before outbound mail.

Send Gmail as plaintext `body` only. Never `htmlBody` for outreach. Paste real URLs such as https://netie.ai/hire/ never https://www.google.com/url?q=...

